# pack/publish-time artifact (scripts/stamp-git-sha.mjs). Tracking this in git
# makes checkout-based deployments (e.g. the Vultr rdc-skills-mcp host) report a
# permanently-stale git_sha in /health, since it wins over the runtime
# git-rev-parse fallback. npm-installed copies still get it stamped fresh at
# pack time regardless of gitignore.
git-sha.json
